1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:05,086
Over high mountains and through valleys

2
00:00:05,447 --> 00:00:08,653
With a body like an airplane, the ninja flies freely in the sky

3
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:12,338
Upright and kind, Hattori-kun brings joy to everyone

4
00:00:12,492 --> 00:00:15,672
With round open eyes and a little mouth shut tight

5
00:00:16,005 --> 00:00:19,406
Face concealed, cheeks puffing out

6
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:22,730
Catching villains with agile moves fast as lightning

7
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:26,497
Catching bad guys with strange tricks like magic

8
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,876
Speaking politely and proudly like poetry

9
00:00:31,798 --> 00:00:34,072
"Lost and Found"

10
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:53,219
Yan...

11
00:00:57,203 --> 00:01:00,460
Mom seems really happy today, what's going on?

12
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,270
Because today is Dad's payday

13
00:01:02,311 --> 00:01:05,137
Mom is always extra happy on this day every month

14
00:01:06,117 --> 00:01:08,225
Oh, so that's why

15
00:01:09,498 --> 00:01:10,784
I'm home

16
00:01:11,108 --> 00:01:13,255
Oh, you're back? Great

17
00:01:14,479 --> 00:01:16,245
Here, your slippers

18
00:01:16,822 --> 00:01:19,682
Do you want to eat first or take a bath first?

19
00:01:23,413 --> 00:01:26,090
Why does Dad seem so down today?

20
00:01:26,911 --> 00:01:27,992
What did you say?

21
00:01:28,032 --> 00:01:30,591
Your whole month's salary was pickpocketed?

22
00:01:30,835 --> 00:01:33,755
Keep it down, the kids might hear!

23
00:01:34,422 --> 00:01:36,470
We already heard everything

24
00:01:40,606 --> 00:01:42,297
His whole salary was stolen by a pickpocket

25
00:01:42,337 --> 00:01:44,762
Then won't we have no money to live on this month?

26
00:01:45,489 --> 00:01:47,711
You can try living like poor people

27
00:01:47,752 --> 00:01:49,057
Oh no, that sounds awful

28
00:01:49,097 --> 00:01:50,697
Here, look at these

29
00:01:50,737 --> 00:01:52,418
What are you doing with those leaves?

30
00:01:52,458 --> 00:01:54,578
As long as we ninjas have water and grass

31
00:01:54,618 --> 00:01:56,578
we don't mind going without food for a whole month

32
00:01:56,618 --> 00:01:58,489
Big Brother, I can do it too!

33
00:01:58,542 --> 00:02:01,386
We're not ninjas, how can we do that?

34
00:02:01,486 --> 00:02:02,973
That's true

35
00:02:03,298 --> 00:02:04,060
Kenichi

36
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,819
Why don't I go catch that awful pickpocket?

37
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:08,229
How are you going to catch him?

38
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:10,740
Even though I already reported it to the police

39
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,848
I wonder if they'll catch that pickpocket

40
00:02:13,301 --> 00:02:14,251
Enough talk

41
00:02:14,291 --> 00:02:16,111
Let's eat first, come on

42
00:02:18,926 --> 00:02:21,326
I must use ninjutsu to restore Dad's memory!

43
00:02:21,367 --> 00:02:22,553
Dad, think back

44
00:02:22,593 --> 00:02:25,306
What did that pickpocket look like?

45
00:02:25,484 --> 00:02:27,264
Huh, you guys already found out?

46
00:02:28,166 --> 00:02:31,099
Dad's slowly recovering his memory now

47
00:02:40,925 --> 00:02:44,168
It seems he was pickpocketed on the train

48
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,792
- Hurry and bring it out
- Okay

49
00:02:46,371 --> 00:02:47,194
Here

50
00:02:50,969 --> 00:02:53,858
Dad can slowly recover his memory now

51
00:02:53,898 --> 00:02:56,221
Now, for the suspects on the train...

52
00:02:56,261 --> 00:02:57,482
Let's draw them first

53
00:03:01,427 --> 00:03:02,761
Oh dear, drawing his back...

54
00:03:02,801 --> 00:03:04,620
how can we recognise him from that?

55
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:06,500
Kenichi, don't be so noisy

56
00:03:07,105 --> 00:03:09,109
Dad's remembering clearer and clearer now

57
00:03:09,149 --> 00:03:10,845
He's recalling a lot of things!

58
00:03:14,165 --> 00:03:16,415
Oh dear, this doesn't seem very reliable

59
00:03:17,033 --> 00:03:18,751
Dad, you must keep remembering

60
00:03:18,791 --> 00:03:20,670
You must think carefully

61
00:03:20,789 --> 00:03:22,708
Come on, think a little harder

62
00:03:29,196 --> 00:03:30,580
The drawing is all done!

63
00:03:30,621 --> 00:03:34,072
This is the thief who stole
all of Dad's monthly salary

64
00:03:34,112 --> 00:03:37,031
How can you tell he's a pickpocket just from his looks?

65
00:03:37,137 --> 00:03:38,564
Yeah, how can you tell, Hattori-kun?

66
00:03:38,605 --> 00:03:40,289
Just keep watching

67
00:03:40,330 --> 00:03:41,246
Look

68
00:03:43,182 --> 00:03:44,048
Look

69
00:03:47,535 --> 00:03:48,656
Yan...

70
00:03:48,696 --> 00:03:50,177
Oh no, he really is a thief!

71
00:03:50,217 --> 00:03:51,258
Let's call the police right away!

72
00:03:51,298 --> 00:03:53,267
Let me go track him down

73
00:03:55,301 --> 00:03:57,367
Yan...

74
00:03:58,224 --> 00:04:01,086
The train is about to depart, please board immediately

75
00:04:01,546 --> 00:04:03,268
Oh no, this is bad

76
00:04:03,308 --> 00:04:06,425
How am I going to find that pickpocket in such a big crowd?

77
00:04:09,933 --> 00:04:12,036
That's it, that's him!

78
00:04:13,066 --> 00:04:14,070
Yan...

79
00:04:18,397 --> 00:04:20,739
Yan...

80
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:27,719
He'll definitely fall for it this time, yan...

81
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:36,417
Excuse me

82
00:04:39,419 --> 00:04:41,279
You really are a pickpocket!

83
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,305
Damn it!

84
00:04:42,731 --> 00:04:45,164
-Don't run, yan!
-What's going on?

85
00:04:45,205 --> 00:04:47,408
Listen up, everyone...

86
00:04:47,449 --> 00:04:49,323
-Yan...
-Pickpocket!

87
00:04:50,724 --> 00:04:52,893
Hey, listen up, he's the pickpocket!

88
00:04:54,895 --> 00:04:56,820
Wait... no! I'm not a pickpocket!

89
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:58,425
He's the real pickpocket!

90
00:05:02,077 --> 00:05:03,590
Yan...

91
00:05:17,708 --> 00:05:18,589
Yan...

92
00:05:18,629 --> 00:05:21,454
Man, I never dreamed it would turn out like this

93
00:05:22,258 --> 00:05:23,853
Hey, don't run!

94
00:05:23,894 --> 00:05:25,076
Flying Eagle Technique!

95
00:05:29,125 --> 00:05:30,219
Yan...

96
00:05:37,610 --> 00:05:38,453
Ouch!

97
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:40,266
What on earth is that?

98
00:05:40,351 --> 00:05:42,988
I've retrieved Kenichi's dad's salary pouch

99
00:05:43,029 --> 00:05:44,159
In other words, what was lost has been found

100
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,033
Huh, what did you say?

101
00:05:45,067 --> 00:05:46,827
Oh no, it's gone!

102
00:05:46,867 --> 00:05:48,227
Curse you!

103
00:05:48,267 --> 00:05:49,948
-Ugh, unbelievable!
-I've got the wallet

104
00:05:49,988 --> 00:05:52,390
Farewell for now, yan...

105
00:05:52,431 --> 00:05:54,049
That makes me so mad!

106
00:05:59,418 --> 00:06:02,220
My salary is completely intact, it's all here!

107
00:06:02,261 --> 00:06:04,339
-Thank you so much, Hattori-kun!
-Way to go, Hattori-kun!

108
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:06,713
That's my big brother for you!

109
00:06:09,184 --> 00:06:10,932
Who could be visiting at this hour?

110
00:06:10,973 --> 00:06:13,375
Your skills have left me
utterly amazed

111
00:06:13,415 --> 00:06:15,375
Master, I sincerely beg you to take me as your disciple!

112
00:06:15,415 --> 00:06:16,664
Please take me as your apprentice!

113
00:06:16,705 --> 00:06:18,954
Master, please teach me well!

114
00:06:19,163 --> 00:06:21,742
Wait, how could I do that?

115
00:06:21,783 --> 00:06:23,091
He's a pickpocket, after all

116
00:06:23,131 --> 00:06:25,096
Wouldn't that make me the King of Pickpockets?

117
00:06:27,733 --> 00:06:30,461
"Controlling Others with Ninjutsu"

118
00:06:33,805 --> 00:06:35,940
Now, I want you to turn into a lion

119
00:06:35,981 --> 00:06:38,244
Turn into a lion right now!

120
00:06:38,801 --> 00:06:41,845
In no time at all, you'll become a lion

121
00:06:42,039 --> 00:06:44,702
One, two, three, transform!

122
00:06:47,597 --> 00:06:49,956
Wow, his magic is really amazing!

123
00:06:50,363 --> 00:06:51,276
This kind of magic

124
00:06:51,316 --> 00:06:54,196
is very similar to how we control people with ninjutsu

125
00:06:54,236 --> 00:06:55,473
That's right

126
00:06:55,766 --> 00:06:56,814
Hattori-kun

127
00:06:56,855 --> 00:06:58,396
do you know this kind of magic?

128
00:06:58,437 --> 00:07:01,674
I suppose I do, but I might not be very good at it

129
00:07:01,714 --> 00:07:04,319
In that case, show me a demonstration! Come on

130
00:07:05,494 --> 00:07:07,361
Alright, let me give it a try

131
00:07:07,978 --> 00:07:10,481
First, I'll test it on Shinzo

132
00:07:10,916 --> 00:07:12,780
Shinzo, I want you to keep staring

133
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:14,976
at the flame of this candle

134
00:07:16,442 --> 00:07:18,262
You are a panda now

135
00:07:18,302 --> 00:07:19,806
Remember, you're a panda

136
00:07:19,846 --> 00:07:22,313
These are the bamboo leaves you love to eat

137
00:07:24,968 --> 00:07:26,732
I love eating bamboo leaves!

138
00:07:27,111 --> 00:07:28,573
Shinzo wasn't affected at all

139
00:07:28,613 --> 00:07:30,455
Instead, Shishimaru seems to be hypnotized!

140
00:07:30,495 --> 00:07:33,455
That's because Shinzo wasn't paying attention earlier

141
00:07:33,857 --> 00:07:36,517
The simpler the mind, the easier they are to control

142
00:07:36,668 --> 00:07:38,381
Wow, amazing!

143
00:07:38,421 --> 00:07:39,902
Could I do it too?

144
00:07:40,806 --> 00:07:41,619
Kenichi

145
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:44,345
if you're interested in ninja mind control

146
00:07:44,385 --> 00:07:46,437
I could teach you

147
00:07:50,534 --> 00:07:52,081
Mom, look at me

148
00:07:52,444 --> 00:07:53,438
What is it?

149
00:07:53,478 --> 00:07:54,822
Mom, you're so beautiful

150
00:07:54,863 --> 00:07:56,238
You're the prettiest woman in the whole country

151
00:07:56,278 --> 00:07:57,243
Mom, you're so kind

152
00:07:57,283 --> 00:07:58,838
You're the best mother in the whole country

153
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:01,278
Oh, Kenichi, you're talking nonsense

154
00:08:01,318 --> 00:08:03,598
I know you love Kenichi the most, Mom

155
00:08:03,638 --> 00:08:05,438
so you'll definitely give him plenty of pocket money

156
00:08:05,478 --> 00:08:06,900
and you'll give him so much

157
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:08,488
more than he could ever spend

158
00:08:08,798 --> 00:08:10,820
I knew it, you definitely had an angle

159
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:12,376
Stop talking and eat your dinner

160
00:08:12,417 --> 00:08:14,776
Oh no, it didn't work!

161
00:08:16,383 --> 00:08:17,553
I'm full

162
00:08:19,848 --> 00:08:21,249
Dad, you're truly great

163
00:08:21,289 --> 00:08:22,700
You're the most amazing man in the whole country

164
00:08:22,741 --> 00:08:24,025
Well, of course I am

165
00:08:24,125 --> 00:08:25,071
It didn't work?

166
00:08:25,252 --> 00:08:26,693
Kenichi, what's wrong with you?

167
00:08:26,733 --> 00:08:27,933
You've been talking nonsense this whole time

168
00:08:27,973 --> 00:08:30,412
He wants to learn how ninjas control people with ninjutsu

169
00:08:30,452 --> 00:08:33,052
This kind of technique is basically like hypnosis

170
00:08:33,092 --> 00:08:36,412
Oh, how could Kenichi possibly know magic?

171
00:08:36,452 --> 00:08:37,825
Whoever gets hypnotized by him

172
00:08:37,865 --> 00:08:39,016
must be really simple-minded

173
00:08:39,057 --> 00:08:40,252
Oh no, this is bad!

174
00:08:40,788 --> 00:08:42,291
You should understand

175
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:46,018
the most basic way to control someone with ninjutsu

176
00:08:46,059 --> 00:08:49,219
is to make them focus their attention on you

177
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:51,354
Because that way...

178
00:08:52,155 --> 00:08:53,851
Kenichi, what are you doing?

179
00:08:53,891 --> 00:08:56,171
I'm going to turn the teacher into a fox!

180
00:08:56,211 --> 00:08:58,451
Transform now, transform!

181
00:08:58,492 --> 00:09:00,220
*Cough*...

182
00:09:02,062 --> 00:09:03,356
*Cough*...

183
00:09:03,439 --> 00:09:05,458
Alright, class is dismissed for today

184
00:09:08,761 --> 00:09:11,380
Hurray, it finally worked!

185
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:12,788
I did it!

186
00:09:13,237 --> 00:09:15,182
Hey, Kenichi, what happened?

187
00:09:15,223 --> 00:09:17,710
My mind control ninjutsu worked like a charm!

188
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:20,264
- I turned Teacher into a fox just now
- Huh, really?

189
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:21,955
Let me go check it out first

190
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,437
*Cough*...

191
00:09:26,496 --> 00:09:29,097
Right, I must not have worn enough clothes and caught a cold

192
00:09:29,138 --> 00:09:31,447
I should go have a bowl of hot noodle soup to warm up

193
00:09:31,741 --> 00:09:34,816
Turns out Teacher just has a cold, alright then

194
00:09:36,296 --> 00:09:37,476
It really is true!

195
00:09:37,517 --> 00:09:39,422
Teacher kept howling like a fox the whole time

196
00:09:39,462 --> 00:09:41,433
And even said he wanted a bowl of hot noodle soup!

197
00:09:41,474 --> 00:09:43,630
Amazing, right?

198
00:09:43,671 --> 00:09:45,324
Kenichi, you're pretty impressive!

199
00:09:45,578 --> 00:09:46,854
Since you're so good at it, hypnotize me!

200
00:09:46,895 --> 00:09:49,039
Of course! Here, look into my eyes

201
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,138
Okay, I'm looking

202
00:09:50,179 --> 00:09:53,147
Alright, now I'm turning you into a cat

203
00:09:53,258 --> 00:09:55,664
You are turning into a stray cat!

204
00:09:59,225 --> 00:10:01,309
Oh no, why did it turn out like this?

205
00:10:01,349 --> 00:10:02,350
Alright, Kenichi

206
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:04,954
Today you have to do classroom duty for Yumeko

207
00:10:04,994 --> 00:10:06,245
Get started right away

208
00:10:12,237 --> 00:10:13,858
Kemumaki, will you be alright?

209
00:10:13,899 --> 00:10:15,318
I'm fine, nothing to worry about!

210
00:10:15,358 --> 00:10:16,838
Right, I need to hurry home to practice the piano

211
00:10:16,878 --> 00:10:17,998
I'll be heading off now

212
00:10:18,038 --> 00:10:19,918
Alright, don't worry, go on home

213
00:10:22,886 --> 00:10:24,151
I'm so tired

214
00:10:24,191 --> 00:10:26,189
Good job, follow me

215
00:10:28,599 --> 00:10:31,080
Oh no, Kenichi is under Kemumaki's spell!

216
00:10:31,121 --> 00:10:33,146
I need to find a way to break it

217
00:10:34,085 --> 00:10:35,279
I sense bloodlust!

218
00:10:37,672 --> 00:10:39,605
Oh no, he got away!

219
00:10:40,052 --> 00:10:41,655
Ah... was that Hattori-kun?

220
00:10:42,773 --> 00:10:44,055
Looking for a fight, huh?

221
00:10:44,095 --> 00:10:45,735
Kemumaki, picking on Kenichi like this...

222
00:10:45,781 --> 00:10:47,137
I won't let you get away with it!

223
00:10:49,095 --> 00:10:50,895
Kenichi treats Kemumaki as his master

224
00:10:50,935 --> 00:10:53,455
If we start fighting, Kenichi might get hurt

225
00:10:53,495 --> 00:10:54,848
Yan...

226
00:10:54,889 --> 00:10:55,835
Hattori-kun, don't run!

227
00:10:55,875 --> 00:10:57,028
Kagechiyo, after him!

228
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:00,135
Ah, yan...

229
00:11:01,396 --> 00:11:03,714
You're a mouse now! Alright, little mouse...

230
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:05,954
Go to your master, hurry up!

231
00:11:09,695 --> 00:11:11,814
Oh no, Kagechiyo, what's wrong with you?

232
00:11:16,446 --> 00:11:18,480
Hey... what are you two doing?

233
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:20,803
Oh no, stop that, ouch...

234
00:11:20,843 --> 00:11:22,058
This is bad...

235
00:11:24,715 --> 00:11:26,335
Hattori-kun, you're despicable!

236
00:11:26,369 --> 00:11:28,059
This is outrageous!

237
00:11:29,349 --> 00:11:30,580
Stop it, Kenichi!

238
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,260
You're human! You're a human being!

239
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:33,733
Alright, change back!

240
00:11:36,501 --> 00:11:38,346
Kemumaki, what happened?

241
00:11:38,425 --> 00:11:40,967
Luckily, I finally broke the ninjutsu spell!

242
00:11:41,015 --> 00:11:41,826
That's right

243
00:11:41,867 --> 00:11:43,408
I remember using my jutsu earlier

244
00:11:43,448 --> 00:11:45,238
and successfully controlling you

245
00:11:45,365 --> 00:11:47,032
The spell hasn't been dispelled yet!

246
00:11:47,072 --> 00:11:49,355
All right, I'll undo it for you

247
00:11:49,396 --> 00:11:52,300
All right, Kemumaki, now concentrate and listen

248
00:11:52,341 --> 00:11:54,546
I want you to turn back into a human, one, two, three!

249
00:11:54,642 --> 00:11:56,796
Oh dear, huh? Why am I here?

250
00:11:56,836 --> 00:11:59,116
Because I controlled you with jutsu earlier!

251
00:11:59,157 --> 00:12:00,539
Oh, so that's it!

252
00:12:00,996 --> 00:12:02,699
I've finally succeeded!

253
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:04,437
I learned ninja jutsu!

254
00:12:04,477 --> 00:12:06,531
Who should I control this time, huh?

255
00:12:06,925 --> 00:12:08,838
That's it, I'll control Yumeko

256
00:12:08,878 --> 00:12:10,598
and make her do my homework for me

257
00:12:11,826 --> 00:12:14,289
Kenichi doesn't even know a spell was cast on him

258
00:12:14,329 --> 00:12:16,248
This is really going to be a huge mess

259
00:12:16,288 --> 00:12:17,928
-Such a pain
-What a nuisance

260
00:12:17,968 --> 00:12:20,184
Yan...

261
00:12:23,503 --> 00:12:26,284
"Shishimaru Turns into a Baseball"

262
00:12:33,797 --> 00:12:34,714
Hurry up!

263
00:12:37,410 --> 00:12:38,660
Watch this!

264
00:12:41,849 --> 00:12:44,163
I'm scared, help!

265
00:12:46,081 --> 00:12:49,051
So cowardly, not like a man at all!

266
00:12:49,221 --> 00:12:51,969
Hiding behind me like that is so embarrassing!

267
00:12:52,104 --> 00:12:53,157
But...

268
00:12:54,209 --> 00:12:55,112
Hey, Kenichi

269
00:12:55,153 --> 00:12:57,195
Come on, hide behind me, heh

270
00:12:57,650 --> 00:12:58,458
That's great!

271
00:12:58,531 --> 00:12:59,585
Let's do that!

272
00:13:00,913 --> 00:13:02,852
Kenichi is really pathetic

273
00:13:14,839 --> 00:13:17,166
I'm sorry, Kenichi, I'm really sorry

274
00:13:18,456 --> 00:13:19,693
So embarrassing!

275
00:13:20,881 --> 00:13:21,972
Ridiculous!

276
00:13:22,618 --> 00:13:24,223
Why should you lack confidence like this?

277
00:13:24,264 --> 00:13:26,395
The most important thing is to train yourself first!

278
00:13:26,436 --> 00:13:28,899
That's impossible, because I don't like sports!

279
00:13:28,939 --> 00:13:30,561
Kenichi, can you really tolerate

280
00:13:30,601 --> 00:13:32,623
being bullied by Kemumaki all the time?

281
00:13:32,666 --> 00:13:34,463
No, but I...

282
00:13:35,604 --> 00:13:36,578
There's no other way

283
00:13:36,619 --> 00:13:37,905
Then do you really not mind

284
00:13:37,945 --> 00:13:39,860
Yumeko making fun of you, huh?

285
00:13:39,901 --> 00:13:40,975
It's so shameful!

286
00:13:41,016 --> 00:13:42,493
Even child prodigies

287
00:13:42,533 --> 00:13:44,572
have to work hard to succeed!

288
00:13:44,612 --> 00:13:46,271
All right, come on!

289
00:13:46,331 --> 00:13:48,051
Yan...

290
00:13:49,168 --> 00:13:51,407
-Kenichi, pull yourself together!
-Kenichi, pull yourself together!

291
00:13:51,496 --> 00:13:52,711
All right

292
00:13:57,178 --> 00:14:00,475
Kenichi, you can't close your eyes!

293
00:14:02,647 --> 00:14:03,791
Is it like this?

294
00:14:03,831 --> 00:14:04,902
Exactly!

295
00:14:05,272 --> 00:14:06,994
If you get scared and dodge the ball

296
00:14:07,034 --> 00:14:10,242
the ball will shatter the window behind you

297
00:14:11,077 --> 00:14:12,412
If you don't want Mom to scold you

298
00:14:12,453 --> 00:14:14,399
you'll have to catch the ball with all your might!

299
00:14:14,439 --> 00:14:15,840
All right, get ready!

300
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:17,402
It's coming in hot!

301
00:14:17,442 --> 00:14:18,683
Whoa, that's so scary!

302
00:14:18,723 --> 00:14:20,983
Yan...

303
00:14:21,445 --> 00:14:23,165
Oh dear, I can't bear to watch!

304
00:14:25,465 --> 00:14:27,535
It's a rubber-band ball, you can't throw it

305
00:14:27,665 --> 00:14:29,792
Oh, you really scared me to death

306
00:14:30,562 --> 00:14:33,386
I've totally lost the will to try

307
00:14:37,213 --> 00:14:39,180
- Big brother, get Shishimaru to help!
- What?

308
00:14:39,650 --> 00:14:42,363
We can throw Shishimaru like a baseball

309
00:14:44,299 --> 00:14:47,656
Shishimaru, you are turning into a baseball now

310
00:14:48,303 --> 00:14:50,995
You're slowly getting rounder and rounder

311
00:14:51,036 --> 00:14:53,796
Just like a ball, that's it, rounder and rounder

312
00:14:53,836 --> 00:14:56,100
Completely round, that's right

313
00:14:56,140 --> 00:14:57,983
Turning into a baseball

314
00:14:58,077 --> 00:14:59,521
And one more thing, this baseball...

315
00:14:59,561 --> 00:15:01,626
Must obey all of Kenichi's orders!

316
00:15:01,667 --> 00:15:03,252
Yan...

317
00:15:07,144 --> 00:15:09,343
That's amazing! Now that I have this ball...

318
00:15:09,383 --> 00:15:10,982
I won't lose to Kemumaki!

319
00:15:11,022 --> 00:15:15,540
But remember not to touch the shuriken mark on Shishimaru's forehead

321
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:17,500
And you must never say the word "lion"

322
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:19,059
Because he loves lions

323
00:15:19,099 --> 00:15:20,606
If he hears you shout "lion"...

324
00:15:20,646 --> 00:15:22,098
He'll turn into a lion!

325
00:15:22,138 --> 00:15:23,919
Got it, don't worry

326
00:15:23,959 --> 00:15:25,265
Off I go!

327
00:15:25,657 --> 00:15:27,815
Yan...

328
00:15:30,980 --> 00:15:33,986
Kenichi, are you planning to challenge me with that ball?

329
00:15:35,263 --> 00:15:37,532
I'd advise you not to waste your time

330
00:15:37,667 --> 00:15:38,866
Kenichi, what are you doing?

331
00:15:38,911 --> 00:15:41,644
Are you really going to have a baseball pitch-off with Kemumaki?

332
00:15:41,909 --> 00:15:43,910
Yumeko, we're having a match!

333
00:15:44,141 --> 00:15:44,944
Alright then!

334
00:15:44,984 --> 00:15:47,020
Today, I'm going to give it my all!

335
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:48,872
You'd better do your best!

336
00:15:50,627 --> 00:15:52,514
I'm counting on you this time

337
00:16:00,955 --> 00:16:02,458
Oh, what was that?

338
00:16:03,061 --> 00:16:04,715
Look out!

339
00:16:10,293 --> 00:16:12,053
Alright, leave the catch to me!

340
00:16:13,931 --> 00:16:15,193
Ouch, that's strange

341
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,178
Why did I get scratched by the ball?

342
00:16:17,252 --> 00:16:18,739
Whoa, awesome!

343
00:16:18,780 --> 00:16:19,738
That's amazing!

344
00:16:19,778 --> 00:16:21,771
What was that pitching technique called just now?

345
00:16:21,812 --> 00:16:24,819
Listen up, this is my original Phantom Ball!

346
00:16:25,419 --> 00:16:26,813
See how great I am!

347
00:16:27,016 --> 00:16:28,610
Let's go to the concert together, okay?

348
00:16:28,650 --> 00:16:30,119
Kenichi, watch out!

349
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:31,688
Outrageous!

350
00:16:32,822 --> 00:16:34,356
I'm not afraid of you!

351
00:16:37,450 --> 00:16:40,107
Kenichi, you've really improved a lot!

352
00:16:40,175 --> 00:16:42,120
You flatter me, am I really that good?

353
00:16:42,528 --> 00:16:45,056
By the way, when are you free to go to the concert with me?

354
00:16:45,097 --> 00:16:46,334
Any time is fine

355
00:16:46,374 --> 00:16:48,535
Hey, why haven't you thrown the ball back yet?

356
00:16:48,575 --> 00:16:49,929
Are you scared of me?

357
00:16:49,970 --> 00:16:52,413
Alright, wait a second, let me take care of him first

358
00:16:52,657 --> 00:16:55,192
Kenichi Magic Ball, second pitch!

359
00:16:56,942 --> 00:16:59,741
Go quickly, be like a lion! Oh no...

360
00:17:06,516 --> 00:17:08,207
Oh no, trouble...

361
00:17:17,178 --> 00:17:19,981
Shishimaru, please hurry and turn back into a baseball

362
00:17:20,021 --> 00:17:21,487
We're not done playing yet

363
00:17:24,439 --> 00:17:26,056
Help!

364
00:17:26,099 --> 00:17:27,572
-Help...
-Serves you right...

365
00:17:27,613 --> 00:17:28,951
Kagechiyo!

366
00:17:28,992 --> 00:17:31,303
Hurry! Ouch, help...

367
00:17:31,443 --> 00:17:32,789
Serves you right!

368
00:17:38,461 --> 00:17:40,622
Yan...

369
00:17:43,237 --> 00:17:44,405
Yan...

370
00:17:45,666 --> 00:17:48,425
Shishimaru, you turned into a bird

371
00:17:57,996 --> 00:17:59,809
Help!

372
00:17:59,850 --> 00:18:01,371
Kenichi, calm down

373
00:18:01,411 --> 00:18:03,241
It's just Shishimaru, you know

374
00:18:03,749 --> 00:18:04,763
Shishimaru?

375
00:18:05,731 --> 00:18:08,696
Then why did Shishimaru turn into a bird?

376
00:18:09,172 --> 00:18:11,732
Hey... D-Don't do that

377
00:18:11,772 --> 00:18:13,165
It's gross, hey

378
00:18:13,206 --> 00:18:14,460
Hey... Ow...

379
00:18:14,501 --> 00:18:18,133
Kenichi is such a coward, he'll never succeed at anything
